# CanIUse data (now fetched from GitHub and cached at edge - no longer bundled)

# Generated build artifacts: the og-image is a headless screenshot of the homepage,
# regenerated by every build (scripts/generate-og-screenshot.mjs) and shipped from
# .output/public, so the repo does not carry it.
public/og-image.png

# Local harness config (omp context-file discovery). Kept out of the repo by
# request: harness/agent configuration is machine-local, not project source.
.omp/

# Task tracking files (personal notes, not part of project)
/*.md
!README.md

# Beads / Dolt files (added by bd init)
.beads/
.dolt/
*.db
.beads-credential-key
# Gate lock bd leaves in the repo root after runs with configured quality gates
.beads.gate.lock
